<title>SPAIN: Spain 10-yr spread to Bund narrows to 59 b.p..</title>
<headline>Spain 10-yr spread to Bund narrows to 59 b.p..</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10-year Spanish bond yield spread to its German counterpart narrowed on Monday to a historic minimum of 59 basis points, dealers said.</p>
<p>The prior minimum of 60 basis points was set on June 19.</p>
<p>Despite the narrowing spread, the Spanish bond market was down slightly with other markets amid worries it might face profit-taking, dealers said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
